{"name":"Cake Crumbs","hex":"#e8d4bb","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"cake crumbs","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Used other than figuratively or idiomatically: see cake,‎ crumbs.","Hardly anything."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/cake_crumbs"}],"entries":[{"title":"Cake","blocks":[{"text":"Cake is a baker's confectionery made by combining flour with a liquid, a fat or both, and usually with a leavening agent. Cakes are usually baked, but can be griddled. In their oldest forms, cakes were modifications of bread, but cakes now cover a wide range of preparations that can be simple or elaborate and which share features with other desserts such as pastries, meringues, custards, and pies."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/04/Pound_layer_cake.jpg/330px-Pound_layer_cake.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cake","wikidata":"Q13276"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7b/Bartolom%C3%A9_Esteban_Perez_Murillo_-_Baking_of_Flat_Cakes_-_WGA16350.jpg/500px-Bartolom%C3%A9_Esteban_Perez_Murillo_-_Baking_of_Flat_Cakes_-_WGA16350.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7b/Bartolom%C3%A9_Esteban_Perez_Murillo_-_Baking_of_Flat_Cakes_-_WGA16350.jpg/500px-Bartolom%C3%A9_Esteban_Perez_Murillo_-_Baking_of_Flat_Cakes_-_WGA16350.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Baking of Flat Cakes by the Spanish painter Bartolomé Esteban Murillo, c. 1650","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABartolom%C3%A9_Esteban_Perez_Murillo_-_Baking_of_Flat_Cakes_-_WGA16350.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f5/Cake_mix_in_plastic_packet_photo.JPG/500px-Cake_mix_in_plastic_packet_photo.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=p